cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "IM3 Tethys CONUS multi-sector water-demand dataset (1/8 degree, monthly, 1980-2100)"
abstract: "A gridded (1/8 degree), monthly, multi-sector water-demand dataset for the contiguous United States covering 1980-2100, downscaled with Tethys from a GCAM-USA scenario ensemble. Includes irrigation, thermoelectric, domestic, livestock, manufacturing, and mining demands, separately for withdrawals and consumption, plus per-cell groundwater-to-surface water source attributions."
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: "10.57931/3366643"
url: "https://github.com/IMMM-SFA/tethys_integration_metarepo"
keywords:
  - water demand
  - water scarcity
  - downscaling
  - GCAM-USA
  - Tethys
  - CONUS
  - multisector dynamics
  - IM3
